------------------------------------------------------------------------
tmbstan 1.2.0 (2026-07-23)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

o Fix compatibility with rstan 2.36+ and remove outdated rstan
  compatibility <=2.26 (thanks to Andrew Johnson).

------------------------------------------------------------------------
tmbstan 1.0.5 (2023-03-21)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

o Sampling with bounds failed in cases with only one parameter (now fixed).

o Stan model is now autogenerated on installation (thanks to Andrew Johnson).
  This fixes incompatibility with future StanHeaders 2.31.
